FFmpeg 7 support, backported from the GStreamer main branch onto 1.22.12:

447ee0b56637723e7c046ef6c5e3e3abb308f71f avvidec: Fix usage of deprecated field
ebf7966a264d0274f305bc1e7cb5d1488f6e91b9 avvidec: Fix more deprecated symbol
bbf6b4e63466a1b14b19d2265b3ebd398eb54091 libav: Port channel layout and counting to AVChannelLayout
f2c9d9baa1caf62866bc7562d257a8a5ef148c34 libav: Port frame counting to frame_num
4dc955e94a30c67b0961ee40ce6ccb4da7c2f245 libav: Port reordered_opaque usage to ref-counted opaque_ref
b46559102bf5934986da20f895920401dcc28237 libav: Port deprecated AVFrame fields to flags
978b75b18aa7190f5e9aff8306a6ae644f6a4b9e avauddec: Use proper version guard
781fc4a1b6fed93f23a4bd5847cabe2fe9146d43 avviddec: Fix crash with FFmpeg n6.0
383723e09525f66d05f3547ddf3d771687521e36 libav: guard dropped AV_CODEC_ID_AYUV api
f137e41a09efc6400e7814c42255d3aaf7a3f9c5 libav: guard dropped AV_OPT_TYPE_CHANNEL_LAYOUT
bd7b5b166d0437c4de0e4a77b871891eda61a098 avdemux: Remove typefinder implementation
2cdaa79da6109ef070d7746804f85e1cbf99a454 libav: Fix signature of avprotocol write function for ffmpeg 7
d871f34b39c106aaf3dd199d0eebc7b1612f9f55 libav: Update AVCodecContext lifetime to work properly with ffmpeg 7

Conflicts resolved by dropping the DSD hunk (not in 1.22) and keeping
the frame counting in gst_ffmpegviddec_frame().

